, reported being watched by a strange man while walking her dog, raising concerns about potential connections to the crime.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/idaho-student-murders-loose-door-hinges-man-lurking-in-the-shadows-series-of-creepy-incidents-that-preceded-the-killings/articleshow/122891919.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/idaho-student-murders-loose-door-hinges-man-lurking-in-the-shadows-series-of-creepy-incidents-that-preceded-the-killings/articleshow/122891919.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-25T06:13:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122891957,imgsize-73726.cms"/></item><item><title>NYPD cop suspended for sleeping on duty: Naked boat thief escapes hospital; manhunt on</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122890827.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nypd-cop-suspended-for-sleeping-on-duty-naked-boat-thief-escapes-hospital-manhunt-on/articleshow/122890827.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nypd-cop-suspended-for-sleeping-on-duty-naked-boat-thief-escapes-hospital-manhunt-on/articleshow/122890827.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-25T03:44:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122890835,imgsize-43578.cms"/></item><item><title>Starlink outage: Internet down in US and abroad; Musk says ‘sorry, won’t happen again’</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122890543.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/starlink-outage-internet-d